{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57154","headline":"率题六章 第一章叹伫归珠至今获 · 傅翕","name":"率题六章 第一章叹伫归珠至今获","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"携明是今日，感应在明阳。\n想思深洞尽，企子实难当。\n朝忆生眷恋，夕望动心伤。\n若期灵树下，度脱不相忘。\n忍见孤憔悴，惧愿普趋蹡。\n双飞白日顶，出气紫云光。\n神龙左右梵，散花来芬芳。\n菲菲常乐境，蔼蔼昇金堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"傅翕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57154.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57154","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}